version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >
  Build the Future is a five-day machine learning bootcamp curriculum
  designed for teenagers aged 13 to 17 with no prior coding experience.
  Delivered in July 2026 by CREED Aberdeen at RCCG Fountain of Love,
  Aberdeen, Scotland. The curriculum covers the full CRISP-DM workflow
  from data preparation through to model deployment, using Python and
  Google Colab. Participants built and deployed a live trend-prediction
  tool (TrendCaster) using XGBoost, and presented original data projects
  on the final day.
